{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026tVlS4C1Oor1794280024.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>《美食新聞報道》首站由蕭博士帶領蔡景行前往元朗，探訪一家充滿懷舊風情的人氣糖水舖，重溫現今市面上已極為罕見的傳統古早味。</p><p></p><p>店內的招牌遠年陳皮紅豆沙極具功力，選用粒粒飽滿的大顆紅豆，加入遠年陳皮慢火燉煮，入口滿是濃郁甘香的陳皮韻味且完全不帶酸澀。傳統的石磨芝麻糊湯圓口感細膩順滑，芝麻香氣極其濃郁。而蛋白杏仁茶則香氣生津，質感綿密。最特別的莫過於腐竹馬蹄清心丸，店家堅持加入如今相當罕見的潮州傳統清心丸，口感 Q 彈爽滑，搭配清甜的馬蹄與腐竹，完美還原經典懷舊風味。</p><ul><li><p><strong>店舖資料：</strong> 滔滔甜品（元朗康樂路8號康樂廣場地下9號舖）</p></li></ul><p><p><img alt=\"6eaeb8ce-6f9c-4bf9-a6b2-f1fd3ea0298e.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026WcRpwfnFd41794280025.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"4e31d7e7-9df4-4f69-9225-b128077a6ce7.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026NmlAjpUych1794280025.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"f7451cdb-b79d-48a4-aac8-2cb8959ef583.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026KJW9IvabxK1794280025.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"ec9998bb-81f0-44de-8a10-e483180ba72a.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/20261dR2QEeXE11794280026.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>隨後，施焯日與波波（黃婧靈）來到中環，解鎖極具人氣的邪惡系美食。店內熱賣的焗薯系列令人大呼過癮，酸忌廉煙肉碎焗薯配迷迭香牛油濃郁香滑，迷迭香的草本香氣恰到重要地平衡了油脂感。而肉醬焗薯配蒜蓉牛油則淋滿濃郁肉醬，蒜香誘人，邪惡指數爆表。烘焙方面，店內的招牌手工葡撻源自超過 300 年前葡萄牙修道院的傳統秘方製作，外皮酥脆、內餡流心感十足，更帶有淡雅優雅的肉桂香氣。另一款命名為「上帝的麵包」（Pão de Deus）的葡萄牙傳統糕點，風味宛如港式椰絲包與雞尾包的完美結合，香甜鬆脆。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"9acfcc99-1e33-43fe-9cfc-3d37c544c370.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/20263Oo1FVEQ6e1794280026.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"fd52b26d-bafb-4929-a1a4-7980d865a21e.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026kD3LcrkVxY1794280027.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"d0085aca-9bd3-46b2-9302-85bf20690698.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026GAFX4LBib71794280027.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"09cd8f48-8b29-4f36-8ec0-1b68df530387.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026OdTvNHUnqM1794280027.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"9a64f16c-0293-49ad-b07f-548156e9de98.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026q4VUAfQxJt1794280028.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"24e08496-0d74-4756-8bec-187479d67943.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026JGGgePL4uf1794280028.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T14:22:03.448692+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":503,"images":11,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T13:06:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T19:59:48.527186+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T14:15:16.799658+00:00","content_hash":"8ccccd96250eea8dbfb1843e6b5d70a684c9dc9babd7151b6ee08d05bcd47d29","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T14:22:03.448692+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}